<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
        <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="ie=edge">
        <title>Reset Password - Focus-Flow</title>
        <style>
            * {
                margin: 0;
                padding: 0;
                box-sizing: border-box;
            }
            
            body {
                font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;
                line-height: 1.6;
                color: #374151;
                background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e3a8a 50%, #312e81 100%);
                margin: 0;
                padding: 0;
                position: relative;
            }
            
            .background-pattern {
                position: fixed;
                top: 0;
                left: 0;
                right: 0;
                bottom: 0;
                opacity: 0.1;
                background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 20px 20px, rgba(255,255,255,0.15) 1px, transparent 0);
                background-size: 40px 40px;
                pointer-events: none;
                z-index: 1;
            }
            
            .collaboration-bg {
                position: fixed;
                top: 0;
                left: 0;
                right: 0;
                bottom: 0;
                overflow: hidden;
                pointer-events: none;
                z-index: 2;
            }
            
            .connection-lines {
                width: 100%;
                height: 100%;
                opacity: 0.1;
            }
            
            .container {
                position: relative;
                z-index: 10;
                width: 100%;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                padding: 32px 16px;
            }
            
            .card {
                background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
                backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
                border-radius: 16px;
                box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
                border: 0;
                width: 100%;
                height: min-content;
                max-width: 680px;
                padding: 48px 40px;
                text-align: center;
                position: relative;
                z-index: 15;
                margin-right: auto;
                margin-left: auto;
            }
            
            .icon-container {
                width: 64px;
                height: 64px;
                background: #dbeafe;
                border-radius: 50%;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                margin: 0 auto 24px;
            }
            
            .mail-icon {
                width: 32px;
                height: 32px;
                color: #2563eb;
            }
            
            .title {
                font-size: 28px;
                font-weight: 700;
                color: #111827;
                margin-bottom: 8px;
            }
            
            .subtitle {
                font-size: 16px;
                color: #6b7280;
                margin-bottom: 16px;
                line-height: 1.5;
            }
            
            .email-display {
                background: #f9fafb;
                border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
                border-radius: 8px;
                padding: 4px;
                margin-bottom: 16px;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                gap: 8px;
            }
            
            .email-icon {
                width: 16px;
                height: 16px;
                color: #6b7280;
            }
            
            .email-text {
                font-weight: 500;
                color: #374151;
                font-size: 16px;
                width: 100%;
                text-align: center;
            }
            
            .cta-button {
                display: inline-block;
                background: #2563eb;
                color: white;
                text-decoration: none;
                padding: 7px 16px;
                border-radius: 4px;
                font-weight: 600;
                font-size: 16px;
                margin-bottom: 8px;
                transition: background-color 0.2s;
                border: none;
                cursor: pointer;
            }
            
            .cta-button:hover {
                background: #1d4ed8;
            }
            
            .fallback-text {
                font-size: 14px;
                color: #6b7280;
                margin-bottom: 8px;
            }
            
            .fallback-link {
                color: #2563eb;
                text-decoration: none;
                word-break: break-all;
                font-size: 14px;
            }
            
            .fallback-link:hover {
                text-decoration: underline;
            }
            
            .divider {
                height: 1px;
                background: #e5e7eb;
                margin: 16px 0;
            }
            
            .help-section {
                text-align: left;
            }
            
            .help-title {
                font-size: 14px;
                font-weight: 600;
                color: #374151;
                margin-bottom: 8px;
            }
            
            .help-list {
                list-style: none;
                padding: 0;
                margin: 0;
            }
            
            .help-item {
                font-size: 12px;
                color: #6b7280;
                margin-bottom: 4px;
                padding-left: 8px;
                position: relative;
            }
            
            .help-item:before {
                content: "•";
                position: absolute;
                left: 0;
            }
            
            .footer {
                margin-top: 16px;
                padding-top: 12px;
                border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
                text-align: center;
            }
            
            .footer-text {
                font-size: 12px;
                color: #9ca3af;
                margin-bottom: 8px;
            }
            
            .support-link {
                color: #2563eb;
                text-decoration: none;
                font-size: 12px;
            }
            
            .support-link:hover {
                text-decoration: underline;
            }
            
            @media (max-width: 640px) {
                .card {
                    margin: 16px;
                    padding: 24px 16px;
                }
                
                .title {
                    font-size: 24px;
                }
            }
        </style>
    </head>
    <body>
        <div class="background-pattern"></div>

        <div class="collaboration-bg">
            <svg class="connection-lines" viewBox="0 0 1200 800">
                <defs>
                    <linearGradient id="connectionGradient" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="100%">
                        <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#3b82f6"/>
                        <stop offset="50%" stop-color="#8b5cf6"/>
                        <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#06b6d4"/>
                    </linearGradient>
                </defs>
                <path d="M100,200 Q300,100 500,200 T900,300 Q1100,200 1200,400" fill="none" stroke="url(#connectionGradient)" stroke-width="2" opacity="0.6"/>
                <path d="M0,400 Q200,300 400,400 T800,500 Q1000,400 1200,600" fill="none" stroke="url(#connectionGradient)" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.4"/>
                <path d="M200,100 Q400,50 600,150 T1000,200" fill="none" stroke="url(#connectionGradient)" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.3"/>
            </svg>
        </div>

        <div class="container">
            <div class="card">
                {{!-- <div class="icon-container">
                    <svg class="mail-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                    <path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"/>
                    <polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"/>
                    </svg>
                </div> --}}
            
                <h1 class="title">Reset your password</h1>
                <p class="subtitle">
                    Focus-Flow.com has received a request to reset your password. If you did not make this request, you can safely ignore this email.
                </p>
            
                <div class="email-display">
                    <svg class="email-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"/>
                        <polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"/>
                    </svg>
                    <span class="email-text">{{email}}</span>
                </div>
            
                <a class="cta-button" href="{{confirmationUrl}}">Reset Password</a>
                
                <p class="fallback-text">If the button doesn't work, copy and paste this link into your browser:</p>
                <a class="fallback-link" href="{{confirmationUrl}}">{{confirmationUrl}}</a>
            
                {{!-- <div class="divider"></div> --}}
{{!--             
                <div class="help-section">
                    <p class="help-title">Didn't receive the email?</p>
                    <ul class="help-list">
                        <li class="help-item">Check your spam or junk folder</li>
                        <li class="help-item">Make sure {{email}} is correct</li>
                        <li class="help-item">The link will expire in 24 hours</li>
                         <li class="help-item">Contact support if you continue having issues</li>
                    </ul>
                </div> --}}
                
                <div class="footer">
                    <p class="footer-text">This email was sent to {{email}} because you created an account on Focus-Flow.</p>
                    <a class="support-link" href="mailto:support@yourapp.com">Need help? Contact Support</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </body>
</html>
